      <p begin="01:48.500" end="01:52.320" ttm:agent="v1">다시 나는 속지 않아, you know I'm so bad</p>
      <p begin="01:52.320" end="01:56.060" ttm:agent="v1">혼자만 남겨져 눈물이 fallin'</p>
